        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 02-Z2, Elite Collection Egg Knob with Cambridge Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA true classic, the Egg Knob with Cambridge Rose is available in 5 finishes. Choose from medium bronze, oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, brushed nickel, and antique pewter. This knobset is great for pre-drilled doors. The rosette has a 2-5/8 inch diameter. Even a first timer can install this knob. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. And since it is part of Fusion Hardware's Elite Collection, it features concealed screws for a polished look once it is installed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 02 Z2 Egg-Shaped Knob with Cambridge Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Classic Egg Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knob with Cambridge Rose, Fusion 02-Z2",
                "description": "Fusion 02-Z2, Egg Knob with Cambridge Roses -- A true classic, the Egg Knob with Cambridge Rose is available in 5 finishes. Choose from medium bronze, oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, brushed nickel, and antique pewter. This knobset is great for pre-drilled doors. The rosette has a 2-5/8 inch diameter. Even a first timer can install this knob. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. And since it is part of Fusion Hardware's Elite Collection, it features concealed screws for a polished look once it is installed.\r\n",
